  "changes": [
    "Discover component-bound async factories with expanded structural WIT schemas; capture original nominal schema and index privately.",
    "Create owned nonthenable future/stream reader and writer endpoints and validate typed bounded writes.",
    "Retain payload wrappers until native ownership receipts; return fresh owned partial/cancelled remainders, preserving bytes, wide integers, Unicode and nested futures.",
    "Soft-close collected stream writers, dispose unconsumed owned payloads, and recheck native ownership before collecting completed/foreign/stale writers.",
    "Intentionally retire an unfinished future producer quietly; preserve genuine callback/destructor errors and reject pending public work.",
    "Share the native 64-pending-call limit so collectors defer without throwing under queue pressure, while returned contexts have a separate 1024-context bound.",
    "Materialize payload-free stream units as dense undefined elements; require matching ABI 11 runtime and engine archives."
  ],
